  <bpmn:collaboration id="L4_01_COLLAB" name="Define trial-specific iPD criteria">
    <bpmn:documentation>Model: L4-01
Title: Define trial-specific iPD criteria
Parent: L3 A1
Interface: start S1; ends E1; message flows M1
Rule exception: ROL-03 P_INV - D1 (orchestrator default, 06 Nov 2026): Investigator/institution is an expanded pool on all levels because investigator obligations are binding steps that must appear as tasks</bpmn:documentation>
